<div class="payment-ready"><h3>🔒 PAYMENT SYSTEM — RESERVED INTEGRATION AREA</h3><p>Reserved for future secure checkout, subscriptions, club payments, franchise payments, receipts, account activation and referral reward automation.</p><code>PAYMENT_PROVIDER_PLACEHOLDER • API • CHECKOUT • WEBHOOK • BACKEND</code></div>
<div class="notice" data-i18n="paymentsNotice">GitHub Pages can display the payment interface, but real payment processing, account activation, subscription verification and automatic referral-link freezing require a payment provider and secure backend/server.</div>
